WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
So now compared to before, the beauty with

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:05.480
Quickler is we actually can see how long it

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.960
takes to edit the report.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:11.840
It's taking, on average, between five to ten minutes.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.760
And some of this is actually because we've chosen

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.760
to leave the activity of adding certain things until

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.160
we go back to the office.

